    "unit_id": "t0002.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 478,
    "char_start": 344,
    "end": 36.462,
    "sent_id": "t0002.s04",
    "start": 26.732,
    "text": "Before we get started, Lena Hofmann was on the last episode and said that tire pressure is more important than suspension adjustments.",
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 492,
    "char_start": 479,
    "end": 37.398,
    "sent_id": "t0003.s01",
    "start": 36.462,
    "text": "Yes, exactly.",
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 543,
    "char_start": 493,
    "end": 41.0,
    "sent_id": "t0003.s02",
    "start": 37.398,
    "text": "And that connects to what we are discussing today.",
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 637,
    "char_start": 544,
    "end": 46.979,
    "sent_id": "t0004.s01",
    "start": 41.0,
    "text": "I'd like to point something out – Lena Hofmann mentioned the same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 732,
    "char_start": 638,
    "end": 53.025,
    "sent_id": "t0004.s02",
    "start": 46.979,
    "text": "I'd like to point something out – Stefan Brandt mentioned the same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 766,
    "char_start": 733,
    "end": 54.708,
    "sent_id": "t0004.s03",
    "start": 53.025,
    "text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 846,
    "char_start": 767,
    "end": 58.738,
    "sent_id": "t0004.s04",
    "start": 54.708,
    "text": "What did you believe about it previously, and what have you revised since then?",
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 986,
    "char_start": 847,
    "end": 69.084,
    "sent_id": "t0005.s01",
    "start": 58.738,
    "text": "In most cases, the mysterious creaking noises can be resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and tightening them to the specified torque.",
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 1043,
    "char_start": 987,
    "end": 73.252,
    "sent_id": "t0005.s02",
    "start": 69.084,
    "text": "We've seen this work with teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 1122,
    "char_start": 1044,
    "end": 79.058,
    "sent_id": "t0005.s03",
    "start": 73.252,
    "text": "The framing is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 1150,
    "char_start": 1123,
    "end": 80.937,
    "sent_id": "t0006.s01",
    "start": 79.058,
    "text": "This is a useful framework.",
    "unit_id": "t0006.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 1204,
    "char_start": 1151,
    "end": 84.626,
    "sent_id": "t0006.s02",
    "start": 80.937,
    "text": "Where do maintenance and the drive mechanism overlap?",
    "unit_id": "t0006.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 1227,
    "char_start": 1205,
    "end": 86.223,
    "sent_id": "t0007.s01",
    "start": 84.626,
    "text": "That's my perspective.",
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 1322,
    "char_start": 1228,
    "end": 93.045,
    "sent_id": "t0007.s02",
    "start": 86.223,
    "text": "A bike should feel quiet and predictable, so that your attention remains focused on the trail.",
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 1389,
    "char_start": 1323,
    "end": 97.835,
    "sent_id": "t0007.s03",
    "start": 93.045,
    "text": "And the second-order effect is the part that most people overlook.",
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 1423,
    "char_start": 1390,
    "end": 99.988,
    "sent_id": "t0008.s01",
    "start": 97.835,
    "text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
    "unit_id": "t0008.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 1500,
    "char_start": 1424,
    "end": 104.948,
    "sent_id": "t0008.s02",
    "start": 99.988,
    "text": "What is the structural perspective that most listeners don't have access to?",
    "unit_id": "t0008.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 1511,
    "char_start": 1501,
    "end": 105.657,
    "sent_id": "t0009.s01",
    "start": 104.948,
    "text": "Certainly.",
    "unit_id": "t0009.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 1593,
    "char_start": 1512,
    "end": 111.397,
    "sent_id": "t0009.s02",
    "start": 105.657,
    "text": "Chain wear is the best early indicator of when you need to replace your cassette.",
    "unit_id": "t0009.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 1645,
    "char_start": 1594,
    "end": 115.012,
    "sent_id": "t0009.s03",
    "start": 111.397,
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
    "unit_id": "t0009.u01"
  },
