    "char_start": 4934,
    "end": 342.005,
    "sent_id": "t0032.s02",
    "start": 338.298,
    "text": "What is the most underestimated part of the drive mechanism?",
    "unit_id": "t0032.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5090,
    "char_start": 4995,
    "end": 348.929,
    "sent_id": "t0033.s01",
    "start": 342.005,
    "text": "To be honest, chain wear is the best early indicator of when you need to replace your cassette.",
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5146,
    "char_start": 5091,
    "end": 352.938,
    "sent_id": "t0033.s02",
    "start": 348.929,
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that use Shimano components.",
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5199,
    "char_start": 5147,
    "end": 356.728,
    "sent_id": "t0033.s03",
    "start": 352.938,
    "text": "I've observed this pattern in three different teams.",
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5225,
    "char_start": 5200,
    "end": 358.201,
    "sent_id": "t0034.s01",
    "start": 356.728,
    "text": "Where does it break down?",
    "unit_id": "t0034.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5360,
    "char_start": 5226,
    "end": 367.391,
    "sent_id": "t0035.s01",
    "start": 358.201,
    "text": "And when teams adopt this process from Shimano, the compromise becomes apparent – I've observed this pattern in three different teams.",
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5412,
    "char_start": 5361,
    "end": 370.801,
    "sent_id": "t0036.s01",
    "start": 367.391,
    "text": "What is the heuristic that you always fall back on?",
    "unit_id": "t0036.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5466,
    "char_start": 5413,
    "end": 374.345,
    "sent_id": "t0036.s02",
    "start": 370.801,
    "text": "Where do maintenance and the drive mechanism overlap?",
    "unit_id": "t0036.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5566,
    "char_start": 5467,
    "end": 381.055,
    "sent_id": "t0037.s01",
    "start": 374.345,
    "text": "To be honest, service intervals for the suspension are a decision made by the risk management team.",
    "unit_id": "t0037.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5633,
    "char_start": 5567,
    "end": 385.529,
    "sent_id": "t0037.s02",
    "start": 381.055,
    "text": "And the second-order effect is the part that most people overlook.",
    "unit_id": "t0037.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5709,
    "char_start": 5634,
    "end": 390.98,
    "sent_id": "t0038.s01",
    "start": 385.529,
    "text": "Before we wrap up, is there one thing that listeners can try out this week?",
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5778,
    "char_start": 5710,
    "end": 396.373,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s01",
    "start": 390.98,
    "text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5801,
    "char_start": 5779,
    "end": 398.118,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s02",
    "start": 396.373,
    "text": "The rest is iteration.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5870,
    "char_start": 5802,
    "end": 403.644,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s01",
    "start": 398.118,
    "text": "Before we close, I'd like to thank our friends at Linear once again.",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5945,
    "char_start": 5871,
    "end": 409.657,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s02",
    "start": 403.644,
    "text": "Linear is the issue tracker built for speed – designed for keyboard users.",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5992,
    "char_start": 5946,
    "end": 412.381,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s03",
    "start": 409.657,
    "text": "Jonas Richter, thank you for the conversation.",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6011,
    "char_start": 5993,
    "end": 414.074,
    "sent_id": "t0041.s01",
